
# <type>(<optional-scope>)!?: <subject>
#
# Types:   feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | perf | test | build | ci | chore | revert
# Subject: imperative mood ("add" not "added"), under 72 chars, no trailing period
# Breaking change: put ! before the colon, e.g.  feat!: drop --legacy flag
#
# Examples:
#   feat: add diff parser
#   fix(cli): handle empty argv without panic
#   refactor(output): extract parseStdout facade
#
# --- body (optional, wrap at 72) -------------------------------------------
#
#
# --- footer (optional: BREAKING CHANGE:, Refs:, Co-authored-by:, etc.) -----
